        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[name=\"Tomimi\"]  Didn't she ever tell you?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Tomimi",
        "content": "Didn't she ever tell you?"
    },
    {
        "id": 91,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  Didn't I?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "Didn't I?"
    },
    {
        "id": 93,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  Eh. I guess I didn't, but it's not like it was important enough to come up.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "Eh. I guess I didn't, but it's not like it was important enough to come up."
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  Dunno who my parents were, but that's not all that rare in these parts.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "Dunno who my parents were, but that's not all that rare in these parts."
    },
    {
        "id": 95,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  Doctor, it may not make sense to you, but death is pretty common out here.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "Doctor, it may not make sense to you, but death is pretty common out here."
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  It doesn't even take a Catastrophe—honestly, nobody here knows what Catastrophes are—a single cold or a bout of bad weather can kill off folks who would've lived otherwise.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "It doesn't even take a Catastrophe—honestly, nobody here knows what Catastrophes are—a single cold or a bout of bad weather can kill off folks who would've lived otherwise."
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  I'd guess my parents just went like that.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "I'd guess my parents just went like that."
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  Eugh. Let's quit this talk. All you need to know is the tribe raised me.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "Eugh. Let's quit this talk. All you need to know is the tribe raised me."
    },
